# Compose

Follow `AGENTS.md`. For non-trivial Compose work, use `.agents/skills/docker-compose-orchestration/SKILL.md`.

Prefer modern Compose Specification syntax, preserve existing service/network/volume semantics, keep secrets out of YAML, and validate only changed Compose files without starting the stack.
